1. Decode BP string → list of {item_id, lat, long, rotation, recipe}
2. For each building:
   a. Determine which band it's in (on the source radius)
   b. Compute its fractional position within that band (0–1)
   c. Find the corresponding band on the target radius
   d. Map fractional position → new lat/long on target grid
   e. Snap to valid grid cell
3. Re-encode with correct MD5F hash → new BP string